  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Land of the Goblins",
      "text": "Talk to Grubfoot in the Dorgeshuun Mines.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Mistag, why won't you let Grubfoot into the city?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I'll take responsibility for Grubfoot."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "questInterfaceOpen"
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[Accept Quest]<ul><li>Dismiss any familiar or Grubfoot won't follow you.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "questStarted"
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Yu'biusk",
      "text": "With Grubfoot following, enter Dorgesh-Kaan using the door to the south and head north-west where Oldak is.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In the north-west room, talk to Zanik.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "So why have you come to talk to Zanik?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What was this new dream?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "How do you know your dream was true?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "[Any option]"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I promise not to tell anyone where the temple is."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I'm ready."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": " Then let's go!"
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "You not a goblin!",
      "text": "If you forgot to bring the toadflax potion, proceed until Zanik has entered into the temple.<ul><li>Otherwise, you will need to go back to Oldak in Dorgesh-Kaan to meet with her, and provide him two law runes and one molten glass.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [
        {
          "name": "Black mushroom ink",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        },
        {
          "name": "Vial",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        },
        {
          "name": "Toadflax potion (unfinished)",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        }
      ],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Once you teleport with Zanik, head north-west to the temple entrance blocked by two goblin guards.<ul><li>Pick and grind a black mushroom into an empty vial if you don't already have black mushroom ink.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to the guards and they will allow Zanik to pass into the temple.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to the Makeover Mage south-west of Falador.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "More..."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Can you turn me into a goblin?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I need to slip past some goblin guards."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Can you turn me into a goblin or not?"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": ""
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the pharmakos berries on an unfinished toadflax potion to create the goblin potion.<ul><li>(Optional) After making the potion, collect another set of pharmakos berries if planning to complete the Contract Claws mystery.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Head to the goblin cave (just north of the Ardougne lodestone).",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Transmogrification",
      "text": "Unequip all items and dismiss any followers.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [
        {
          "name": "Goblin mail",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        }
      ],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In front of the goblin guards, drink the goblin potion (pick any goblin appearance).",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Climb down the entrance.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Me want get into temple."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Yes, I'm [goblin name]."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "North, sitting on his throne, talk to the High Priest.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Can you tell me about Yu'biusk?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I understand the ways of the Big High War God."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I'm ready for the test."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": ""
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Take the quiz.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "True."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "The Big High War God commands it."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "False."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Goblins were not mighty warriors before he chose us."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "False."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "That's one of the commandments."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Lead goblins to victory over the whole world."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": " That right! And war will end in victory and victory last forever!"
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "After the quiz, ask about Yu'biusk.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Can you tell me about Yu'biusk?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Where is Yu'biusk?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Never mind."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": ""
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Dye your goblin mail black with the mushroom ink.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Wear the black goblin mail and go in the north-east room by talking to the goblin in the passage.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Pickpocket the priest for a key. Keep this key. You will need it later.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to Zanik in the prison cell.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Sit tight. I'll be back soon."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": ""
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Search the crate in the room to find the teleport sphere.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to Zanik again, she will teleport.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I have a teleport sphere here."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": " Oh, thank you, [Player]!"
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Whitefish",
      "text": "Leave the cave.<ul><li>You can equip a piece of equipment to be thrown out, then you can teleport to Draynor.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [
        {
          "name": "Coins",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        },
        {
          "name": "Black goblin mail",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        },
        {
          "name": "Slimy eel",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        }
      ],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to Aggie in Draynor Village.<ul><li>Or, if Vampyre Slayer is complete.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "More..."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Can you make dyes for me please?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Can you make black or white dye?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "More..."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Can you make dyes for me please?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Can you make black or white dye?"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": " Black dye can be made by grinding up black mushrooms. That's dead easy. The mushrooms grow in some old caves and ruins, and you can grind them up yourself with a pestle and mortar."
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Teleport to Seers' Village lodestone and head south-west to Hemenster near the Ranging Guild. Alternatively, use a combat bracelet.<ul><li>Be sure to have a raw slimy eel or you will have to repeat the next steps.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Attempt to open the gate near Morris.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I need to catch a Hemenster whitefish."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": ""
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "After finishing the dialogue, open the gate.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Catch a whitefish.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Return to Aggie and use the goblin mail on her.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Macabre crypt",
      "text": "Unequip any items and dismiss any followers.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [
        {
          "name": "Blue dye",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        },
        {
          "name": "Yellow dye",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        },
        {
          "name": "Purple dye",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        },
        {
          "name": "Orange dye",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        }
      ],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Go back to the goblin temple entrance, take a sip of your goblin potion, and equip your white goblin mail.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Enter the temple.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Steal the white key from the priest in the room west of the temple.<ul><li>Remove the goblin mail to leave the room quicker.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Repeat the operation of stealing keys, dying your mail in the following order:<ul><li>Yellow (north-west)</li><li>Purple (south-west)</li><li>Orange (south-east)</li><li>Blue (east)</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Prepare for battle",
      "text": "Enter the crypt (large door north of the temple).",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Prepare for battle by equipping weapons and armour.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the Say-name option on each of the graves. After killing them, talk to them.<ul><li>South-west: Snothead</li><li>South-east: Snailfeet</li><li>North-west: Mosschin</li><li>North-east: Redeyes</li><li>North: Strongbones (ignore his skeleton minions)</li></ul>",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Where is Yu'biusk?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What was your predecessor's name?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Goodbye."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Snailfeet"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Mosschin"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Redeyes"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Strongbones"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to Strongbones after defeating him.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Where is Yu'biusk?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Goodbye."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": " Goodbye, human. I am sure that the Chosen Commander will find what she is looking for when you bring her to Yu'biusk."
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Home portal",
      "text": "Return to Dorgesh-Kaan and speak with Zanik in the north-west (Oldak's lab).",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "With a light source, head to the south end of Dorgesh-Kaan using fairy code AJQ. Alternatively, without using fairy rings:<ul><li>Go up the stairs to the agility course.</li><li>At the start of the agility course, climb down the ladder west of the agility cable.</li><li>Follow the cave path east then south to the Fairy ring.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
